r. Might hit, might backfire.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/cb6d1a74075faaebd1b73a54cabf67ba.poster.avif?t=1769715544\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/cb6d1a74075faaebd1b73a54cabf67ba.webm?t=1769715544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/cb6d1a74075faaebd1b73a54cabf67ba.mp4?t=1769715544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/561a754c5307a9532c7a0835ab40afcb.avif?t=1769715544\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player starts with 3 cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a card equal to or higher than the one on the table. Same-number cards can be played together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a new card for each one you play. Always keep 3 in hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t have any cards to play? Your head inflates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special cards can change everything. Use them smart or chaotic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play smart. Keep your skull safe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/016124e2596934cc1cc70ab5e896417a.poster.avif?t=1769715544\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/016124e2596934cc1cc70ab5e896417a.webm?t=1769715544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/016124e2596934cc1cc70ab5e896417a.mp4?t=1769715544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/9a0c57e41c024f42a2a832ca3ab8d0b0.avif?t=1769715544\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each round, one player becomes the VORP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A topic and secret word are chosen. Everyone sees the word except the VORP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players write clues. The VORP fakes a clue and tries to guess the word.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, players discuss and vote on who they think the VORP is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the real VORP is caught, they must guess the word. Fail, and they lose a life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose all lives, and you're off to meet your alien god.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/8057d07a783d23318a081072ecee664c.poster.avif?t=1769715544\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/8057d07a783d23318a081072ecee664c.webm?t=1769715544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/extras/8057d07a783d23318a081072ecee664c.mp4?t=1769715544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >See You In The Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your seat in <strong>Bogos Binted?</strong> right now and dive into chaotic fun with the galaxy\u2019s most disposable, big-eyed companions. Just remember: no one here tells you to \u201cplay fair.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019re aliens. They don\u2019t even speak English.</p>","developers":["underbadger"],"dlc":[4365770],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588490/840d222a83bc4aedb5b390ab02835042925e2427/header.jpg?t=1769715544","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3588490/1526085590/55c1289c280fbb32cf927e006313ba00fc1c786d/1769589516/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769596679","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3588490/1526085590/55c1289c280fbb32cf927e006313ba00fc1c786d/1769589516/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769596679","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3588490/1526085590/55c1289c280fbb32cf927e006313ba00fc1c786d/1769589516/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769596679","id":257274447,"name":"Bogos Binted? Full Release - Launch Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257274447/445d0de6e3d0f9405c0b157de340aac965ad362f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769596679"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3588490/1715365997/db5c57c1133275db3db9d7d29b542d71b0128b41/1753226742/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753229771","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store